{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04365","headline":"洛中晴月送殷四入关 · 刘希夷","name":"洛中晴月送殷四入关","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清洛浮桥南渡头，天晶万里散华洲。\n晴看石濑光无数，晓入寒潭浸不流。\n微云一点曙烟起，南陌憧憧遍行子。\n欲将此意与君论，复道秦关尚千里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}